{"id":"cf95789b-82b8-46a0-832b-ee4f560eeaef","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"a041ab86c04cefed","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/shell/sign-in.tsx","baseline":{"blob":"083837e823c3d34ae25345a4cfcdb07dd7f25e44","start":31,"end":78},"shape":{"type":"ImportDeclaration","atoms":["import","type","{","FunctionComponent","}","from","\"","preact","\""]},"context":{"after":"87d329ca426cc8ea"}},"payload":{"text":"Signing in (session.ts), optional: a full-page round trip through the API's sign-in page, finished as this page loads\nagain; who's signed in (GitHub's login, fetched live through the API's proxy — the API keeps no login — or the\naccount's email); where you're signed in, each session's way out and the account's; and your account, in a dialog\n(account-dialog.tsx). The session (oauth4webapi), the client (fido) and the dialog are imported only when needed, so\nthey code-split out of the cold-start bundle. Its section is the GitHub popover's first (github-control.tsx).","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T17:38:48.175Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T17:38:48.175Z"}
